<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Contract</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>offer &lt;player&gt;
contract &lt;player&gt;
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>offer Joe
contract Joe
</pre>
<p>These commands hire one of the NPC mercenaries, such as the Assassin who 
walks the streets of Midgaard, to kill another player for money: offer asks 
the price, contract pays it. A mercenary takes no contract on a monster, an 
immortal, yourself or a player of level 20 or below. See <a cmd='#'>Help Contract</a> for 
the details.
</p><p>See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Contract</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Player Killing</a>
</pre>




</div>